msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫............"

#: prologue:prologue_9C5985A3_A450_4279_89AD_E4C9055CB369
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dbce05300a184cd784498d8499503b1f8e4f55caf9284192fc608b10215d7fbc
#. default-sha256: 30d55a7f8c705a0f3a246e9129f02bbea8de6147900de99f14929c5859d3f2e4
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_9C5985A3_A450_4279_89AD_E4C9055CB369"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What’s the occasion? You never come to wake me up."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫A cosa devo l’onore? Non sei mai venuta a svegliarmi."

#: prologue:prologue_68962FD1_5789_4814_BF46_B3586D07440A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5d46b6d4f069734c250e2ec59adb5dece8a47ecc21f25ce17987ea162ac8c0cd
#. default-sha256: 7fc0e949afd7b45bffe7d1c9882d987c54f9a2475d438f2d36be1d9eb259919f
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_68962FD1_5789_4814_BF46_B3586D07440A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I was merely concerned for your health.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You really should be sleeping in a "
"proper bed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ero solamente preoccupata per la tua salute.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Dovresti seriamente dormire in un "
"letto vero."

#: prologue:prologue_CF9E89B3_32AE_40C3_9AFC_47CEAC6DA8C3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd4bbbb07f448a40167d97381c8f6106c7413e8972a8d67a69647e2554ee404b
#. default-sha256: 9cc506b344970ce15c1a9500803fb3dfcd6f38af6b1d401fa7c3c83ee33ebc6f
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_CF9E89B3_32AE_40C3_9AFC_47CEAC6DA8C3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You were ⟪k:3⟫concerned⟪k:4⟫? About ⟪k:5⟫me⟪k:6⟫?⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫You do realize the "
"concept of “health” bears little meaning for either of us, don’t you?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eri ⟪k:3⟫preoccupata⟪k:4⟫? ⟪k:5⟫Per ⟪k:6⟫me⟪k:7⟫?⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Ti sei accorta o no che "
"il concetto di “salute” non ha alcun significato per noi due?"

#: prologue:prologue_42F500E6_AADF_4523_B5D0_46846E73867B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7fa0296aff03cec326d6a883d4e83771400ebaab59dec62533fc786d41a208ea
#. default-sha256: f06d540b9d8a34279c7f6bd82a45bd11c295d2deda30bc24eacb6dfd97bee747
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_42F500E6_AADF_4523_B5D0_46846E73867B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Why would I not be concerned? ⟪k:2⟫You ⟪k:3⟫are⟪k:4⟫ me.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫If something were to "
"cause you to depart this world,⟪k:7⟫the same would happen to me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Perché non dovrei essere preoccupata? ⟪k:2⟫Tu sei ⟪k:3⟫me⟪k:4⟫.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Se dovesse "
"accaderti qualcosa e finissi per abbandonare questo mondo, lo stesso accadrebbe a me."

#: prologue:prologue_B351EC4B_885F_482C_B4CB_BCEFFF7E34F7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 15262002e6e672181db1bea08e651cf2c451c882f053020285d0b4f1ace11797
#. default-sha256: 515f663b98c8781724f919d397c830b00ae3bdfc186b96e4ac4fe15ef3f621eb
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_B351EC4B_885F_482C_B4CB_BCEFFF7E34F7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ahh... ⟪k:3⟫right.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫That’s true."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ahh... ⟪k:3⟫già.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫È⟪k:7⟫ vero."

#: prologue:prologue_219F44A4_AECD_4C4F_AFBA_6559324490AB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a328b4706e0d5116b9e1b0383a54e5cfe0169c2605d92003b3a6f202fe11dc60
#. default-sha256: 940fe1d20e9bd039bac0ba0775bf12267979337c94c1bbffca24eb0d9bbcf982
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_219F44A4_AECD_4C4F_AFBA_6559324490AB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(It was so long ago, I almost forgot I told her she was me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫And it would seem she "
"still believes that to be the case.)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫(⟪k:1⟫È⟪k:2⟫ passato così tanto che mi ero quasi dimenticata di averle detto che lei era me."
"⟪k:3⟫ E a quanto pare continua a credere che sia così.)"

#: prologue:prologue_3BF7FF21_91E5_45AA_8A70_93A97AE211F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 19dcfb0e8aa3349b4a6ce56a039d8e3cdb78f2c28cba970e5ec13f46da935368
#. default-sha256: c6fd0a263fe6e3094f9620990c04a84c04d7d2ecca3da6869b23b1cc2b9aba70
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_3BF7FF21_91E5_45AA_8A70_93A97AE211F1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(Foolish woman.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(Stupida donna.)"

#: prologue:prologue_2494829B_6EF8_4259_8A89_724BF8C2E9BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eae89c160b97d0837311108f75e03edfb8754cdcb9978932e2a123abf0f95951
#. default-sha256: 8a55db3687cea7c3641932e94bf75fbe2d66d46f1ee1cddd02553f594e165a30
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_2494829B_6EF8_4259_8A89_724BF8C2E9BE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hehe... ⟪k:2⟫What kind of herbal tea would you like to start your day with?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I "
"have some lovely mint leaves, if you would like.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫They are wonderful for improving one’s "
"mood."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hehe... ⟪k:2⟫Con quale tipo di tisana ti piacerebbe iniziare la giornata?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Ho "
"delle adorabili foglie di menta, se vuoi.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Sono ottime per migliorare l’umore."

#: prologue:prologue_A3379ACC_2922_40DF_B93A_42D0249E6756
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7b125f5277e054b0934f6b2c44aed06ac22608f79660b70940773aa2ad78b39c
#. default-sha256: 49707d78b96ed6e845ee5bc24f9926ed4c7792db1f382caa68efc1ba0657b688
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_A3379ACC_2922_40DF_B93A_42D0249E6756"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I have no interest in—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫or need for—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫tea."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non mi va nessuna tisana,⟪k:3⟫ né tantomeno ne ho bisogno."

#: prologue:prologue_2A7416EA_6EC3_4EC3_B482_0837EB84EE2E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 76bcc5916c2e0e3ad017e77d1f5b014394517ecd84d1249f107a659e6da8ab68
#. default-sha256: 15ec2fad99a6e34aefb17b4587cebcdc7fd74b34e87dab56892eaf1cbe4b4e72
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_2A7416EA_6EC3_4EC3_B482_0837EB84EE2E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That is most unfortunate."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫È⟪k:3⟫ un vero peccato."

#: prologue:prologue_8FC837AF_E40A_4C1D_94F4_77A8DB4EDBD0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bb5aa975c66ad8bc066e4ec0edd8f2c03896863f5d705d723e4ab2035586902d
#. default-sha256: 71d0011e75bf34a58251e848202ff1d7b30ffd6b186041f7ea8e701af89b560f
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_8FC837AF_E40A_4C1D_94F4_77A8DB4EDBD0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫In that case, perhaps you could tell me a story?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫In tal caso, magari potresti raccontarmi una storia?"

#: prologue:prologue_403866E0_6E4F_493B_A27C_2C7EAFE6329E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 68b14ac32582f09124878dc4cd92ed33fdd5c3b11bb3923a7640a85069820eb5
#. default-sha256: 746fea16304357a7666daae246ab9f0782a2169ea081b68dd0dbb835551dc41a
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_403866E0_6E4F_493B_A27C_2C7EAFE6329E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫A story?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You mean the one about Michel and Giselle again?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Una storia?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Intendi quella su Michel e Giselle?"

#: prologue:prologue_0B05D229_DD6F_426C_BBE6_F3909259CA5D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fa09166816dfa3250d25f2a9381a9bd0a96097905085b251b96f5a3c2832fed7
#. default-sha256: 3e652c620781789f0ec22837adc60e42f2de5875d71bd522ba83a3878935228c
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_0B05D229_DD6F_426C_BBE6_F3909259CA5D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Yes, that one.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I do love that story oh so very much."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Sì, quella.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Oh, la amo così tanto."

#: prologue:prologue_4604B25A_659B_44D1_9FFC_0469BC280F95
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 14b73d9c2a9b15c89dbf1ed82d6421e7212739206cf6a89a877561b94cc3a4e8
#. default-sha256: 3fdbc0f86b6cde4df84fedaf7490b143577ff1a6b6decfc9551275a5d676a77e
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_4604B25A_659B_44D1_9FFC_0469BC280F95"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I, for one, am growing rather tired of it.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I’ve told it to you dozens of "
"times now."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Personalmente mi ha stancata.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Te l’ho raccontata un’infinità di volte "
"oramai."

#: prologue:prologue_DB2E9551_BD10_4F5E_B19B_02E32600B333
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b799e49da9f9f21bbcd9170eada151d08d096993e99159e69f21ef268f91820f
#. default-sha256: f9e1daab24fd9f23d8ded079c8ea964a0cd3698992fbe9db8eb326147a330a3c
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_DB2E9551_BD10_4F5E_B19B_02E32600B333"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Now, don’t be like that.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫The best stories never stop being moving,⟪k:4⟫no "
"matter how many times you hear them."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Su, non fare così.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Le storie migliori non smettono mai di commuovere,⟪k:4⟫non "
"importa quante volte le si ascoltino."

#: prologue:prologue_FE9551A9_E7B3_4525_AC83_90F29E5824B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9503f2a53c46af6257d3b7d53233da4b5ac510212926e262b4de7de698447f7d
#. default-sha256: e10e28722be0a237ef7fc3d3c388519df195e3342c05e1972e86763a090d38d8
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_FE9551A9_E7B3_4525_AC83_90F29E5824B3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫(It’s like I’m talking to a child...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫(⟪k:3⟫È⟪k:4⟫ come parlare a un bambino...)"

#: prologue:prologue_9A642A70_8B15_47C9_BD7B_BEB6E479AED8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 21d6e4341ac139e59e33146cdda00f133e6c7d20a3cd42e21023fb1f7ef95315
#. default-sha256: f860be2753a2100346e41e5211c0b7978a2baf230046e1d4e00ab45a9ea2dc5f
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_9A642A70_8B15_47C9_BD7B_BEB6E479AED8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫All right, then, how about this? ⟪k:1⟫I’m going to ask you a question,⟪k:2⟫and if you give "
"me an answer I like, I’ll tell you the story again."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫D’accordo, allora, facciamo così. ⟪k:1⟫Ti farò una domanda,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫e se mi darai la "
"risposta che voglio, te la racconterò di nuovo."

#: prologue:prologue_37041A75_7016_4F96_B9C5_AD3F59AEC5F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 42f7e464ebedb09661ead4c1545ffc5d01900a9705a66248734e621407140227
#. default-sha256: e02245975d9293dc1c2ce7642f33b4d7279f784a452521e69f9b3ea896b6fc3d
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_37041A75_7016_4F96_B9C5_AD3F59AEC5F5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh? What kind of question?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh? Che tipo di domanda?"

#: prologue:prologue_DDEDFAD1_E397_4B12_B05A_473A3CDE182C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 94eb1b80c5f44b7812b8e3983c8cd0ec8c833b58e87d44e50b85607906569161
#. default-sha256: 16676bd8e1990bff10e4a21dc8636ed2d2b8051f20af24bf532b8c328b4d5c32
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_DDEDFAD1_E397_4B12_B05A_473A3CDE182C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hehe... ⟪k:3⟫Nothing difficult, I promise.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I want to hear your opinion on "
"something."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hehe... ⟪k:3⟫Niente di difficile, te lo prometto.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Voglio sapere la tua "
"opinione su una cosa."

#: prologue:prologue_30C3C1BA_1D3D_4D6D_A3C5_556EB160ED24
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6b9d62172d0eea706c713321e471f245177b5bbe0362acda994be8da79855c46
